# Git LFS for the golden-image baselines (scripts/test-goldens.mts): 120 PNGs, ~20 MB, rewritten wholesale
# every time the look is re-blessed on purpose. Scoped by extension so goldens/<profile>/PROFILE.json stays
# plain text that reads in a diff.
#
# A fresh clone needs `git lfs install` (once per machine) before `git clone`, or `git lfs pull` after it.
# Without LFS the baselines check out as pointer text — a .png that is not an image — and test-goldens.mts
# says so rather than reporting 120 decode failures.
test/goldens/**/*.png   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
